# REGISTERS:
# $sp: For backup data using stack
# $v0, $v1: For results
# $a0, $a1, $a2: For print console and file
# $a3: For $count of write_spaces($count)
# $s0: For current player
# $s1: For SIZE
# $s2: For NUM_TO_WIN
# $s3: For x direction
# $s4: For y direction
# $s5: For TIME_LIMIT, ADD_TIME, check cells
# $s6: For determine file
# $s7: For move count
# $t0-$t9: For different purposes(temp)
